# tools.qa (WP5; DESIGN §5.10-§5.18, §15.3): every Tools item is reachable from the
# palette and opens its dialog; nothing is deleted, generated or cleared (the dialogs are
# opened and dismissed; Clear is answered with `n`). The update check uses the recording
# services (no network): the dialog shows `Update error: ...`.
#
# Sandbox: a FRESH COPY of the scratchpad sandbox (tools/qa/new-sandbox.ps1). Run:
#   tools/qa/run-gui.ps1 -Sandbox <sbx> -Exe <qa build> -Scenario crates/gui/qa/scenarios/tools.qa `
#       -Out <dir> -Shots
wait-loaded 15s

# Debug log (also reached by the viewer's Show debug log / parse-error badge).
key secondary-shift-p
type "debug log"
key enter
expect dialog == debug-log
shot tools-debug-log
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Delete empty transcripts: the scan lists the candidates, Close dismisses without deleting.
key secondary-shift-p
type "delete empty"
key enter
expect dialog == delete-empty
wait 800ms
shot tools-delete-empty
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Generate semantic cache: opens idle (never auto-started); Esc closes it.
key secondary-shift-p
type "generate semantic"
key enter
expect dialog == generate-semantic-cache
shot tools-generate-cache
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Clear semantic cache asks first; `n` cancels and the cache stays.
key secondary-shift-p
type "clear semantic"
key enter
expect dialog == clear-semantic-cache
shot tools-clear-cache
key n
expect dialog == none

# Debug search.
key secondary-shift-p
type "debug search"
key enter
expect dialog == debug-search
wait 800ms
type "token"
key enter
wait 800ms
shot tools-debug-search
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Semantic debug search (opens; no run, the model is not needed).
key secondary-shift-p
type "semantic debug"
key enter
expect dialog == semantic-debug
shot tools-semantic-debug
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Delete by session ID: an unknown id is reported, nothing is deleted.
key secondary-shift-p
type "delete conversation by"
key enter
expect dialog == delete-by-id
type "bad/id"
key enter
wait 500ms
shot tools-delete-by-id
key escape
expect dialog == none

# Show projects directory needs a workspace (T-016): without one the palette
# lists it muted and Enter on it runs nothing (the palette stays open).
key secondary-shift-p
type "projects directory"
key enter
expect dialog == palette
expect toast.last !contains "Projects directory"
shot tools-projects-dir-disabled
# The first Esc clears the typed filter, the second closes the palette.
key escape escape
expect dialog == none

# Check for updates (recording services: no network).
key secondary-shift-p
type "check for updates"
key enter
expect dialog == updates
wait 500ms
shot tools-updates
key escape
expect dialog == none

# About.
key secondary-shift-p
type "about"
key enter
expect dialog == about
shot tools-about
key escape
expect dialog == none
expect calls.terminal.count == 0
quit 0

